    dplyr,
    httr,
    jsonlite,
    purrr,
    rjstat,
    rlang,
    stats,
    stringr,
    tibble,
    tidyr,
    utils
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/FaluPeppe/pxweb2r
